  "title": "Trex® Expands Refuge™ Decking Launch Into Northeast Markets",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Trex Company [NYSE: TREX], the world’s largest manufacturer of wood-alternative decking and residential railing, today announced added markets to the limited release of its Trex® Refuge™ Decking – a performance-engineered PVC decking line. Beginning in late March, Trex will expand distribution of Refuge decking across the northeast region of the United States.",
